    <Split>
      <Name>-Clawshot</Name>
      <Note>* Water Bomb chest at start if bought less than 15 bombs
* Bomb arrow stalactites
* Downstairs and left to 2nd lever
* Upstairs and left to first lever
* Downstairs to small key 1
* Back up and right to locked door
* Shoot stalactite and climb vines
* Bomb arrow rock
* Deku Toad</Note>
    </Split>
    <Split>
      <Name>Lakebed</Name>
      <Note>* Small key outside Deku Toad
* Central room clawshot over fence with vines
* Right to clawshot switch
* East water level
* Central room and down stairs
* First chest is 10 water bombs
* Clawshot across to maze room
* Boss key and save warp
* Clawshot chandelier and drop down to boss door</Note>
    </Split>
